  "description": "File-backed knowledge and traceability control plane for a four-role delivery team: cited facts, needs to requirements, stories to platform tasks, briefs, proven changes, and feature documents, operated by agents and reviewed by humans through the CLI, MCP, or a loopback web portal.",
  "id": "OctoEvidence.Cli",
